it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s2.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s2.png\" alt=\"Shot S2\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-h3.png\" alt=\"SIMPLE CLOUDS\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-body3.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-body3.png\" alt=\"Body Section 3\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s3.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s3.png\" alt=\"Shot S3\" /></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Ja2Cbmrne4\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_badges/discord.png\" alt=\"Join the Discord\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://github.com/falling-colud/make-it-compatible-voxy\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_badges/github.png\" alt=\"Source on GitHub\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-hmic.png\" alt=\"Make it Compatible\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sable-make-it-compatible\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_mic/sable-icon.png\" alt=\"Make it Compatible: Sable\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-make-it-compatible\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_mic/mic-ip-icon.png\" alt=\"Make it Compatible: Immersive Portals\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-hrel.png\" alt=\"Related Projects\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/falling-colud/voxy-forged\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-voxy.png\" alt=\"Voxy\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/littletiles\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-littletiles.png\" alt=\"LittleTiles\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sable\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-sable.png\" alt=\"Sable\" /> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-clouds\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-simpleclouds.png\" alt=\"Simple Clouds\" /></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Этот мод может использоваться только с Voxy; необходимый порт можно найти, нажав на значок Voxy выше. Остальные модули не являются жесткими зависимостями.可以自由用于模组包。</em></p>",
